#Linux
Wetonan tulis: (Prentah ls -la), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (Dalan /home gabor Desktop), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: (Dalan /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: ((Prentah ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: ((Prentah do: ['this'], lan: ['that'])), baris-anyar.
Wetonan tulis: ((Dalan go: ['here'], lan: ['there'])), baris-anyar.